--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Deliberate exclusions
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

comic-text-detector (GPL-3.0) and YOLOv8/Ultralytics (AGPL-3.0) are
capable text detectors that are NOT used here. This extension is meant to
be handed to other people, which counts as distribution, and either
licence would extend its terms to the whole extension. Ultralytics also
treats trained weights as covered.

The `license` field on the detector interface exists so this stays a
checkable property rather than a promise in a document.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Services
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Google Gemini API is used for reading and translating text. It is a
service, not bundled code, and each user supplies their own API key. No
developer key is embedded anywhere in this extension.
